Michaël Darakdjian <michael.darakdjian@netcourrier.com> wrote:
> Please tell me, what are the tips for not starving ?

Eat corpses.  But not poisonous ones.  Your pet generally only eats things
which you can eat, which can help you to tell the difference.

Your god can also help you when you start to feel Weak.  But don't 
rely on this too often.


> What races eat the fewest ?

They all eat similarly, but some may be more tolerant of poison.


> What are the common death causes for your games ?

Water moccasins and starvation, but only because of a challenge I have 
set myself.  These are also common deaths for new players; learn not to
die this way.


> Is it easy to be a tourist in nethack ? 

Once you get some decent armor and a stack of daggers, tourists are 
not so bad.  Getting there can be quite a challenge, though, especially 
for the beginner.

